as/01b9e76ea086f2c48b2100cffd6f3146.poster.avif?t=1759301101\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/01b9e76ea086f2c48b2100cffd6f3146.webm?t=1759301101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/01b9e76ea086f2c48b2100cffd6f3146.mp4?t=1759301101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Rich World</strong>: Uncover hidden truths in cryptic murals, echoing voices, and twisted mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/e40c4e4df0ea6930183ef0bece225398.poster.avif?t=1759301101\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/e40c4e4df0ea6930183ef0bece225398.webm?t=1759301101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/e40c4e4df0ea6930183ef0bece225398.mp4?t=1759301101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting and Memorable Art</strong>: A surreal aesthetic will immerse you fully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/db078ab80d9e1b8388659ee2448beb6f.poster.avif?t=1759301101\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/db078ab80d9e1b8388659ee2448beb6f.webm?t=1759301101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/db078ab80d9e1b8388659ee2448beb6f.mp4?t=1759301101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>